{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Create a new control the journaled way: builds the record with the platform's exact internal shape and registers it in the library's controls index, so patch_control_facet / read_control_facet / delete_control work on it immediately. Refuses to clobber an existing control of the same name. Use this instead of hand-writing data-folder records (which corrupts the index). Returns {status, id, name, lib, created}.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse flowlang::flowlang::system::time::time;\nuse flowlang::flowlang::system::unique_session_id::unique_session_id;\nuse ndata::dataobject::DataObject;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;","params":[{"desc":"Library that will own the new control.","name":"lib","type":"String"},{"desc":"Human-facing control name (unique within the library); this is what data-control='lib:name:{}' resolves and what other dev.code commands take as `ctl`.","name":"name","type":"String"},{"desc":"Optional description; discoverable via list_controls / set_control_meta.","name":"desc","type":"String"}],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"isnhix1a108282fe6n3c","readers":[],"time":1791138267460,"username":"system","writers":[]}